    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: SJR-R00-EX-101, SJR-R00-EX-102, SJR-R00-PR-101, SJR-R00-PR-102,  SJR-R00-PR-103,  SJR-R00-PR-104. all received 22/07/2026.\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The detached single storey outbuilding hereby permitted shall not be used for any purposes beyond those that are strictly incidental to the enjoyment of the main house at 10 St John's Road, Feltham, TW13 6NW which, for the purposes of this permission, includes a rehabilitation gymnasium with wet room for the residents of the main house. The outbuilding shall not be used as a self-contained dwelling or contain a bedroom, kitchen or any other primary residential accommodation, nor may it be used for business purposes. \r\nReason: In order to protect neighbours' living conditions and the character of the area.\r\n"
